{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% block content %}
<div class="page">

  <div class="cover">
    <div class="eyebrow">Portfolio Template · Finance Director</div>
    <h1>13 周滚动现金流预测（示例）</h1>
    <div class="sub">从“看得见”到“管得住”：周度现金流入流出、最低现金保有、缺口预警与动作清单</div>
    <div class="meta">
      <span>预测期间：<b>{{ fin.period }}</b></span>
      <span>主体/范围：<b>{{ fin.scope }}</b></span>
      <span>金额单位：<b>{{ fin.unit }}</b></span>
      <span>版本：<b>{{ fin.version }}</b></span>
    </div>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="badge">示例数据 · 脱敏模拟 · 非真实企业数据</span>
      <span class="badge green">W1–W2 实际</span>
      <span class="badge blue">W3–W13 预测</span>
      <span class="badge red">最低现金保有 {{ fin.floor|num }} 万元</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="kpi-row">
    <div class="kpi"><div class="v">{{ fin.opening|num }}<small>万元</small></div><div class="l">期初现金（W1 起点）</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="v">{{ fin.totals.inflow|num }}<small>万元</small></div><div class="l">13 周累计流入</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="v">{{ fin.totals.outflow|num }}<small>万元</small></div><div class="l">13 周累计流出</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="v">{{ fin.totals.net|num }}<small>万元</small></div><div class="l">累计净现金流</div></div>
    <div class="kpi gold"><div class="v">{{ fin.totals.ending|num }}<small>万元</small></div><div class="l">第 13 周末现金</div></div>
    <div class="kpi red"><div class="v">W{{ fin.totals.min_week }}</div><div class="l">最低现金周 · {{ fin.totals.min_amount|num }} 万元</div></div>
    <div class="kpi red"><div class="v">{{ fin.totals.gap_weeks }}</div><div class="l">缺口周数 · 累计缺口 {{ fin.totals.cumulative_gap|num }} 万元</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="v">{{ fin.totals.coverage|pct }}</div><div class="l">第 13 周末安全线覆盖率</div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>现金曲线 <span class="hint">柱：流入/流出；线：期末现金；虚线：最低保有</span></h3>
    {{ fin.chart_svg|safe }}
    <div class="table-note">实线/实底 = 实际（W1–W2）；浅色底 = 预测（W3–W13）。缺口定义：当周期末现金低于最低现金保有 {{ fin.floor|num }} 万元时，差额计入缺口。</div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>13 周现金流主表 <span class="hint">单位：万元</span></h3>
    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style="width:7%">周次</th><th style="width:6%">状态</th><th class="num">期初</th><th class="num">流入</th>
          <th class="num">流出</th><th class="num">净现金流</th><th class="num">期末</th>
          <th class="num">最低保有</th><th class="num">缺口</th><th style="width:7%">灯</th>
        </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
        {% for w in fin.weeks %}
        <tr>
          <td><b>{{ w.label }}</b></td><td>{{ w.status }}</td><td class="num">{{ w.opening|num }}</td><td class="num">{{ w.inflow|num }}</td>
          <td class="num">{{ w.outflow|num }}</td><td class="num">{{ w.net|num }}</td><td class="num">{{ w.ending|num }}</td>
          <td class="num">{{ w.floor|num }}</td><td class="num">{{ w.gap|num }}</td>
          <td>{% if w.light == '绿' %}<span class="pill green">绿</span>{% elif w.light == '黄' %}<span class="pill amber">黄</span>{% else %}<span class="pill red">红</span>{% endif %}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
        <tr class="total"><td>合计</td><td>—</td><td class="num">{{ fin.opening|num }}</td><td class="num">{{ fin.totals.inflow|num }}</td><td class="num">{{ fin.totals.outflow|num }}</td><td class="num">{{ fin.totals.net|num }}</td><td class="num">{{ fin.totals.ending|num }}</td><td class="num">—</td><td class="num">{{ fin.totals.cumulative_gap|num }}</td><td>—</td></tr>
      </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class="table-note">自洽：期初 + 净现金流 = 期末；每周期末 = 下周期初；Σ流入 − Σ流出 = Σ净现金流；缺口 = MAX(0, 最低保有 − 期末)。</div>
  </div>

  <div class="two-col">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>现金结构 <span class="hint">监管内/外 · 受限/非受限</span></h3>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <tr><th>维度</th><th class="num">金额（万元）</th><th class="num">占比</th><th>说明</th></tr>
          <tr><td>监管内资金</td><td class="num">{{ fin.cash.regulatory|num }}</td><td class="num">{{ fin.cash.reg_pct|pct }}</td><td>预售监管账户等</td></tr>
          <tr><td>监管外资金</td><td class="num">{{ fin.cash.non_regulatory|num }}</td><td class="num">{{ fin.cash.non_reg_pct|pct }}</td><td>一般账户</td></tr>
          <tr class="sub"><td>总现金</td><td class="num">{{ fin.cash.total|num }}</td><td class="num">100.0%</td><td>监管内 + 监管外</td></tr>
          <tr><td>受限资金</td><td class="num">{{ fin.cash.restricted|num }}</td><td class="num">{{ fin.cash.restr_pct|pct }}</td><td>保证金/冻结/质押</td></tr>
          <tr><td>非受限资金</td><td class="num">{{ fin.cash.non_restricted|num }}</td><td class="num">{{ fin.cash.non_restr_pct|pct }}</td><td>可自由调度</td></tr>
          <tr class="sub"><td>可用现金</td><td class="num">{{ fin.cash.available|num }}</td><td class="num">{{ fin.cash.avail_pct|pct }}</td><td>总现金 − 受限</td></tr>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>结论与动作 <span class="hint">从数字到管理动作</span></h3>
      <div class="callout red">
        <p><b>最低点：</b>W{{ fin.totals.min_week }} 期末现金 {{ fin.totals.min_amount|num }} 万元，低于最低保有 {{ fin.floor|num }} 万元；共有 {{ fin.totals.gap_weeks }} 周出现缺口，累计缺口 {{ fin.totals.cumulative_gap|num }} 万元。</p>
      </div>
      <ul>
        {% for c in fin.conclusions %}
        <li>{{ c }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>关键假设与口径 <span class="hint">先写假设，再给结论</span></h3>
    <div class="grid-3">
      {% for a in fin.assumptions %}
      <div><b>{{ a.label }}：</b>{{ a.value }}</div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="disclaimer">
      <b>示例数据声明：</b>本页为方法论演示，所有金额、周次、回款率与融资到位假设均为示例，非真实企业数据。实际使用需替换为银行流水、合同回款计划、工程进度与融资批复，并由财务负责人复核。
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <span>示例数据 · 非真实企业 · 方法论演示</span>
    <span>Portfolio Template · Finance · 2026-10</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="page-head">
    <div>
      <h1>集团经营快报（示例）</h1>
      <div class="sub">{{ group.period }} · 合并范围 {{ group.entity_count }} 家项目公司 · 单位：{{ group.unit }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="right">示例数据 · 脱敏模拟<br>非真实企业数据</div>
  </div>

  <div class="kpi-row">
    <div class="kpi gold"><div class="v">{{ group.totals.revenue|num }}<small>万元</small></div><div class="l">合并营业收入</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="v">{{ group.totals.gm|pct }}</div><div class="l">合并毛利率</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="v">{{ group.totals.net|num }}<small>万元</small></div><div class="l">合并净利润</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="v">{{ group.totals.nm|pct }}</div><div class="l">合并净利率</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="v">{{ group.totals.ocf|num }}<small>万元</small></div><div class="l">经营现金流合计</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="v">{{ group.totals.cash|num }}<small>万元</small></div><div class="l">期末现金合计</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="v">{{ group.totals.completion|pct }}</div><div class="l">预算完成率（20 家合计口径）</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="v">{{ group.lights.green }} / {{ group.lights.yellow }} / {{ group.lights.red }}</div><div class="l">红黄绿灯：绿 / 黄 / 红</div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="two-col">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>净利贡献 Top 10 / Bottom 5 <span class="hint">按净利润排名</span></h3>
      {% for b in group.top %}
      <div class="bar-row"><div class="name">{{ b.name }}</div><div class="track"><div class="fill {{ b.cls }}" style="width:{{ b.width }}%"></div></div><div class="val">{{ b.net|num }}</div></div>
      {% endfor %}
      <div class="hr"></div>
      {% for b in group.bottom %}
      <div class="bar-row"><div class="name">{{ b.name }}</div><div class="track"><div class="fill red" style="width:{{ b.width }}%"></div></div><div class="val">{{ b.net|num }}</div></div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>预算偏差 Top 5 <span class="hint">实际 − 预算（收入口径）</span></h3>
      {% for v in group.variance_top %}
      <div class="bar-row"><div class="name">{{ v.name }}</div><div class="track"><div class="fill {{ v.cls }}" style="width:{{ v.width }}%"></div></div><div class="val">{{ v.variance|num }}</div></div>
      {% endfor %}
      <div class="table-note">偏差 = 实际 − 预算；偏差率 = 偏差 ÷ 预算；绿=超预算，红=低于预算。</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>{{ group.entity_count }} 家项目公司快报 <span class="hint">节选全部 {{ group.entity_count }} 家 · 排名按净利润</span></h3>
    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead>
        <tr><th style="width:4%">#</th><th style="width:10%">项目公司</th><th class="num">收入</th><th class="num">毛利率</th><th class="num">净利率</th><th class="num">经营现金流</th><th class="num">预算完成率</th><th style="width:7%">灯</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
        {% for e in group.entities %}
        <tr>
          <td class="c">{{ e.rank }}</td><td><b>{{ e.name }}</b></td><td class="num">{{ e.revenue|num }}</td><td class="num">{{ e.gm|pct }}</td><td class="num">{{ e.nm|pct }}</td><td class="num">{{ e.ocf|num }}</td><td class="num">{{ e.completion|pct }}</td>
          <td>{% if e.light == '绿' %}<span class="pill green">绿</span>{% elif e.light == '黄' %}<span class="pill amber">黄</span>{% else %}<span class="pill red">红</span>{% endif %}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
        <tr class="total"><td>—</td><td>合计 / 合并</td><td class="num">{{ group.totals.revenue|num }}</td><td class="num">{{ group.totals.gm|pct }}</td><td class="num">{{ group.totals.nm|pct }}</td><td class="num">{{ group.totals.ocf|num }}</td><td class="num">{{ group.totals.completion_merged|pct }}</td><td>—</td></tr>
      </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class="table-note">完成率 = 收入 ÷ 预算；合计行按合并收入 235,120 ÷ 245,200 = <b>95.89%</b>，与顶部 KPI 的 99.40% 分子不同源。</div>
  </div>

  <div class="two-col">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>合并桥（收入） <span class="hint">20 家合计 → 抵消 → 合并</span></h3>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <tr><th>项目</th><th class="num">金额（万元）</th></tr>
          <tr><td>20 家收入合计</td><td class="num">{{ group.totals.revenue_sum|num }}</td></tr>
          <tr><td>减：内部交易抵消</td><td class="num">-{{ group.totals.internal_rev|num }}</td></tr>
          <tr class="total"><td>合并营业收入</td><td class="num">{{ group.totals.revenue|num }}</td></tr>
          <tr><td>20 家成本合计</td><td class="num">{{ group.totals.cost_sum|num }}</td></tr>
          <tr><td>减：内部成本抵消</td><td class="num">-{{ group.totals.internal_cost|num }}</td></tr>
          <tr class="total"><td>合并营业成本</td><td class="num">{{ group.totals.cost|num }}</td></tr>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>合并桥（净利） <span class="hint">净利合计 → 抵消 → 少数股东 → 归母</span></h3>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <tr><th>项目</th><th class="num">金额（万元）</th></tr>
          <tr><td>20 家净利润合计</td><td class="num">{{ group.totals.net_sum|num }}</td></tr>
          <tr><td>减：内部利润抵消</td><td class="num">-{{ group.totals.internal_profit|num }}</td></tr>
          <tr><td>减：少数股东损益</td><td class="num">-{{ group.totals.minority|num }}</td></tr>
          <tr class="total"><td>归母净利润</td><td class="num">{{ group.totals.attributable|num }}</td></tr>
          <tr><td>经营现金流合计</td><td class="num">{{ group.totals.ocf|num }}</td></tr>
          <tr><td>期末现金合计</td><td class="num">{{ group.totals.cash|num }}</td></tr>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="callout blue">
    <p><b>三条管理结论：</b>{% for c in group.conclusions %}{{ c }}{% if not loop.last %}；{% endif %}{% endfor %}。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <span>口径：合并范围 {{ group.entity_count }} 家；内部交易抵消 {{ group.totals.internal_rev|num }} 万元；预算版本 {{ group.budget_version }}；红黄绿灯阈值见下。</span>
    <span>绿灯：完成率≥95% 且经营现金流≥0；黄灯：85%–95% 或现金流为负但可覆盖；红灯：&lt;85% 或出现缺口。示例阈值，可按集团制度替换。</span>
  </div>
</div>
{% endblock %}
